  "releaseNotes": "- fix: correct typo in SharedProps.props documentation\\n- fix: update DownloadFile URL to prevent stale cache issues in SharedProps.props\\n- ThunderPropagator.BuildingBlocks: Split shared-props bootstrap into SharedProps.props\\n- Refine CLAUDE.md contributor guidance\\n- fix: correct README.md file path in Directory.Build.props for packaging\\n- docs: update ReadMe.md for improved clarity and structure\\n- docs: rebuild repository documentation\\n- refactor: convert SerializerType to a record struct for improved performance and clarity\\n- refactor: update serializer references for improved clarity in documentation and tests\\n- refactor: update JsonFormatSerializer and NJsonFormatSerializer for improved clarity and consistency\\n- refactor: change internal methods to public for improved accessibility in serialization and encryption classes\\n- refactor: simplify serializer tests by removing unused formats and properties\\n- refactor: update serialization classes and methods for improved clarity and functionality\\n- Ignore TFM-pinned packages in Dependabot\\n- Wire admin push token into CI workflow\\n- Allow manual workflow dispatch to choose beta or release\\n- Fix SAST inputs and pass GitHub token\\n- Gate CI jobs by event type\\n- Unify CI on shared reusable workflow\\n- Centralize CI workflows and add concurrency controls\\n- Tidy dependency groups and SAST schedule\\n- Add NuGet OIDC publish jobs in CI",
